      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$y_n=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(y_{n-1}+\\frac{5}{y_{n-1}}\\right)$，",
        "其中 $n=2,3,4,\\cdots$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们把 $2$ 当作 $y_1$，那么",
        "$y_2=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(2+\\frac{5}{2}\\right)=2.25$，",
        "$y_3=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(2.25+\\frac{5}{2.25}\\right)↵=\\frac{1}{2}(2.25+2.2222)=2.2361$，",
        "$y_4=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(2.2361+\\frac{5}{2.2361}\\right)↵=\\frac{1}{2}(2.2361+2.2360)=2.23605$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们看到，第三次和第四次近似值同样精确到 $0.001$. 于是，在第",
        "三步就得到了问题的答案."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "上面引用的论证可以推广到得到任何正数平方根的逐次近似值的",
        "情形. 例如，对于 $\\sqrt{x}$ 来说，得到逐次近似值的公式将具有下面的形",
        "式：",
        "$y_n=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(y_{n-1}+\\frac{x}{y_{n-1}}\\right)$， $n=2,3,4,\\cdots$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "注. 一般说来，可以把任何正数当作第一次近似值. 但是，如果",
        "希望更快地得到我们所需要的结果，那么就必须尽可能更准确地选取",
        "$y_1$（具有较小的误差）."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "745",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "745. 用逐次逼近法求下列根式的值（准确到 $0.001$）：",
        "а) $\\sqrt{20}$； б) $\\sqrt{36.5}$； в) $\\sqrt{525}$； г) $\\sqrt{95.28}$."
      ]
    },
